  "description": "Independent researcher in applied terminology science and phenomenology of human-AI interaction. Author of the AUGMANITAI Compendium (an extensive terminology corpus for human experiences in AI interaction) and creator of the Holistic Performance Analysis methodology (observable, decomposable, measurable, controllable) - a cross-domain transfer of high-performance sport-science methodology to human-AI interaction analysis. 25+ years of professional sport coaching including multiple years as a Bundesliga tennis coach. Co-author of 'Faszination Padel' (2024). Inspired by ISO 704:2022, ISO 1087:2019, ISO 30042:2019.",
